                                                "sense_id": "11bdf900-772b-3311-a9ed-454dcab37d00",
                                                "text": "The present Immigration Act on the books bars entry to Canada to homosexuals, prostitutes, epileptics, and those said to be \"living off the avails of homosexualism or prostitution.\""
